SUMMARY:Lake Tomahawk Wildlife Garden Workday (Black Mountain)
DESCRIPTION:Join Swannanoa Valley WILD! Chapter of NCWF for a wildlife garden workday at Lake Tomahawk. We’ve already done a lot of work at the garden removing invasive plants and prepping the area for native plants in the future. And there is still a lot of work to do! We hope you’ll join us as we work toward transforming this garden into suitable habitat for wildlife.  \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/lake-tomahawk-wildlife-garden-workday-black-mountain/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/png:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/LTWrokday-1.png
END:VEVENT
