SUMMARY:Brews & Bears (Asheville)
DESCRIPTION:Join ReWild AVL at the WNC Nature Center’s Brews and Bears event!. Watch Black Bears Uno and Ursa enjoy popsicle enrichment. Learn how to help bears in the wild with education from BearWise and Safe Passage Wildlife Crossing Project. Walk the park with your favorite drink in hand and support the wild animals you love with this fundraiser! \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/brews-and-bears/
CATEGORIES:Featured
END:VEVENT
