SUMMARY:Kayak at Cane Creek Reservoir (Waxhaw)
DESCRIPTION:Join Union County Wildlife Chapter leaders as well as park staff on a kayak tour around Cane Creek Reservoir. Staff will demonstrate how to use the kayaks and equipment at the start of the program and then guide the group as we look for different birds\, mammals\, fish\, and other wildlife on the water. \n\nChildren ages 8 and up are welcome to participate but must be in a tandem kayak with a parent. Participants who wish to be in a single kayak MUST be 18 years or older. Kayaks are limited: 9 single and 4 tandems; they will be given out on a first come\, first serve basis\, so please be sure all of the members of your group are registered. Adult participants are allowed to bring their own kayaks if they wish. \nREGISTER HERE
URL:https://ncwf.org/event/kayak-at-cane-creek-reservoir-waxhaw/
CATEGORIES:Featured
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://ncwf.org/wp-content/uploads/UCWCcanecreekkayaki.jpg
END:VEVENT
